WEBVTT

1
00:00:11.067 --> 00:00:16.401
Roxy flew through the air, carrying the heavy vehicles.

2
00:00:16.402 --> 00:00:19.280
"Wow!" yelled someone on the ground.

3
00:00:19.281 --> 00:00:21.882
"Rocket Girl is holding a bus!"

4
00:00:21.883 --> 00:00:25.458
"And a taxi too!" said someone else.

5
00:00:25.459 --> 00:00:30.774
Roxy found a safe, quiet street.

6
00:00:30.775 --> 00:00:34.357
She put down the vehicles.

7
00:00:34.358 --> 00:00:38.376
"Thank you, Rocket Girl!" said a woman on the bus.

8
00:00:38.377 --> 00:00:42.516
"You're my hero, Rocket Girl!" said the taxi driver.

9
00:00:42.517 --> 00:00:45.890
"No problem, folks!" said Roxy.

10
00:00:45.891 --> 00:00:49.549
Roxy blasted off and headed back to West Street.

11
00:00:49.550 --> 00:00:52.028
Snow was still swirling everywhere.

12
00:00:52.029 --> 00:00:55.966
The wind was blowing strong, and deep snowdrifts were forming.

13
00:00:55.967 --> 00:01:00.216
"I've never seen a blizzard this bad!" thought Roxy.

14
00:01:00.217 --> 00:01:03.779
She saw two police cars half buried under the snow.

15
00:01:03.780 --> 00:01:07.710
Some police officers were trying to dig them out.

16
00:01:07.711 --> 00:01:13.671
"Which way did Weatherman go?" Roxy called to the police officers.

17
00:01:13.672 --> 00:01:18.049
"He went that way, toward the mountains," yelled one officer.

18
00:01:18.050 --> 00:01:22.983
Roxy zoomed after the villain, following the van's tracks in the snow.

19
00:01:22.984 --> 00:01:25.740
The wind was howling.

20
00:01:25.741 --> 00:01:29.293
Snow blew everywhere, covering the van's tracks.

21
00:01:29.294 --> 00:01:31.706
Roxy used her super vision.

22
00:01:31.707 --> 00:01:36.422
Far ahead she could see faint lights through the thick falling snow.

23
00:01:36.423 --> 00:01:38.618
"There he is!" she said.

24
00:01:38.619 --> 00:01:42.203
"Now it's time to put a stop to this villain!"

25
00:01:42.204 --> 00:01:44.565
Roxy soon caught up to the van.

26
00:01:44.566 --> 00:01:48.403
She took a deep, deep breath. Then . . .

27
00:01:48.404 --> 00:01:53.293
Whoo-ooo-oosh! Roxy blew as hard as she could.

28
00:01:53.294 --> 00:01:55.951
She let out a powerful gust of wind.

29
00:01:55.952 --> 00:01:59.452
A huge snowdrift formed in front of Weatherman's van.

30
00:01:59.453 --> 00:02:04.785
Boomph! The van slammed into the snowdrift.

31
00:02:04.786 --> 00:02:09.045
"I'll get you for that, Rocket Girl!" shouted Weatherman.

32
00:02:09.046 --> 00:02:12.035
He jumped out of the van and held up a Weather Ball.

33
00:02:12.036 --> 00:02:16.142
He was just about to throw it when—whiz-hoo!

34
00:02:16.143 --> 00:02:22.075
Roxy blasted the ball to pieces with her eye laser beams.

35
00:02:22.076 --> 00:02:27.351
"You won't be creating any more bad weather today!" said Roxy.

36
00:02:27.352 --> 00:02:30.193
"You're going to jail, Weatherman!"

37
00:02:30.194 --> 00:02:34.588
"Agh!" said Weatherman.

38
00:02:34.589 --> 00:02:38.013
"This is so much fun!" said Jack.

39
00:02:38.014 --> 00:02:40.701
"I can't believe it snowed!"

40
00:02:40.702 --> 00:02:46.611
Jack, Mara, and Terrell were making a snowman in Terrell's backyard.

41
00:02:46.612 --> 00:02:50.572
"I wonder when Roxy will be back," said Terrell.

42
00:02:50.573 --> 00:02:53.299
"She's been gone a long time."

43
00:02:53.300 --> 00:02:58.316
"Yeah," said Mara. "She's missing all the fun!"

44
00:02:58.317 --> 00:03:02.455
"Here I am!" called Roxy as she ran into the yard.

45
00:03:02.456 --> 00:03:06.204
"I'm so surprised that it snowed."

46
00:03:06.205 --> 00:03:09.273
Terrell looked at Roxy suspiciously.

47
00:03:09.274 --> 00:03:14.589
"I wonder if Rocket Girl had something to do with it," he said.

48
00:03:14.590 --> 00:03:21.195
"Who knows?" said Roxy with a smile.
